1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
AntSeed brings company conversations, contacts, and follow ups into one board.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,000
This recording uses synthetic messages and authored AI decisions.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,500
The actual Vikunja board has six lanes, from To be started through Completed.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,808
Cedar is a Buyer.

5
00:00:17,808 --> 00:00:23,000
That workstream label is separate from its current progress.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,931
Open the company ticket.

7
00:00:24,931 --> 00:00:30,724
Mira is the C T O, and Jo is the engineering lead.

8
00:00:30,724 --> 00:00:33,138
Both contacts belong to Cedar.

9
00:00:33,138 --> 00:00:37,483
The backend keeps source evidence beside the next action.

10
00:00:37,483 --> 00:00:40,862
AntSeed owes pricing and integration notes tomorrow.

11
00:00:40,862 --> 00:00:43,759
Jo owns a separate external review.

12
00:00:43,759 --> 00:00:51,000
Those commitments keep their original actor and calendar date, instead of
inventing an exact time.

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,500
The setup page exposes actual connection state, chat inclusion, and bounded
history import.

14
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,500
This demo contains one synthetic chat.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:06,500
An operator can exclude a chat or configure the operational group here.

16
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:11,000
Live Telegram login is not shown in this recording.

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,968
The recommendation proposes Work in progress, with evidence and a reason.

18
00:01:15,968 --> 00:01:20,032
Decision is pending, and apply state is not requested.

19
00:01:20,032 --> 00:01:22,290
The board has not moved.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,000
This recommendation is an authored fixture.

21
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Now an explicit operator approval is submitted through the existing H T T P
endpoint.

22
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Approval queues the operation.

23
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:39,500
The normal backend worker handles the move and checks Vikunja.

24
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:45,000
After refreshing the real board, Cedar is in Work in progress.

25
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,500
Database readback confirms stage version one, one committed mutation, and an
applied proposal.

26
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,000
The helper did not move the task.

27
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:01,829
The priorities endpoint returns the current ticket, next action, evidence, and
an upcoming commitment.

28
00:02:01,829 --> 00:02:05,244
The date is interpreted in Asia Kolkata.

29
00:02:05,244 --> 00:02:09,634
AntSeed responsibilities remain distinct from the external contact review.

30
00:02:09,634 --> 00:02:15,000
These same records are available to Hermes through M C P.

31
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,471
A separate recorded independent verification used the actual installed Nous
Hermes agent.

32
00:02:19,471 --> 00:02:23,569
It discovered all twenty seven tools and called propose lane change.

33
00:02:23,569 --> 00:02:30,647
Real database readback found a pending Hermes proposal, while the board stayed
unchanged, with stage zero and no mutations.

34
00:02:30,647 --> 00:02:34,000
No new model run was used for this video.

35
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,308
Start everything with docker compose up.

36
00:02:36,308 --> 00:02:40,154
Local deployment, persistence, approvals, and Hermes have passed independent
checks.

37
00:02:40,154 --> 00:02:45,538
Live Telegram onboarding remains outstanding, and successful Jev inference is
blocked by Gateway credits.

38
00:02:45,538 --> 00:02:49,000
Those limits are separate from the working local demonstration.
